<p>
  Information still flows across the full image — just with graph diameter 2 instead of 1.
  A patch token at the top-left corner can influence a patch at the bottom-right:
  both attend to the same cores, and those cores attend to both patches.
  It takes two hops instead of one. The paper shows this is sufficient for competitive performance.
</p>

<div class="math-block">
  <div class="math-label">VECA attention cost per layer</div>
